        "text": "Malthe Taarngaard Jakobsen (born 29 October 2003) is a Danish racing driver who is set to compete in the FIA World Endurance Championship for McLaren. He previously drove for Peugeot. Jakobsen is the 2022 European Le Mans Series champion in the LMP3 class with Cool Racing and three-time champion of the Asian Le Mans Series.",
